They are.
确实。

714
00:26:13.830 --> 00:26:18.470
Oscar's the dad, Kevin is Oscar's dad, and Angela is Kevin's mom.
奥斯卡是爸爸，凯文是奥斯卡的爸爸，而安吉拉是凯文的妈妈。

715
00:26:18.690 --> 00:26:18.930
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

716
00:26:18.970 --> 00:26:20.370
That's how Kevin breaks it down.
凯文就是这么划分的。

717
00:26:20.550 --> 00:26:20.610
Yeah.
是啊。

718
00:26:21.250 --> 00:26:22.610
Gabe says he wants to go, too.
盖博说他也想去。

719
00:26:22.790 --> 00:26:25.710
Apparently, he loves maternity warts.
显然，他很喜欢产房。

720
00:26:25.970 --> 00:26:26.170
Yes.
是的。

721
00:26:26.290 --> 00:26:28.590
He says they're the perfect blend of love and horror.
他说那是爱与恐怖的完美结合。

722
00:26:29.130 --> 00:26:29.430
Great.
太棒了。

723
00:26:29.870 --> 00:26:32.310
We did have a fan catch from Afrin R.
我们收到了一位来自圣安东尼奥的粉丝Afrin R.的提问，

724
00:26:32.430 --> 00:26:33.770
