然后她就没下文了。

747
00:27:32.650 --> 00:27:37.470
Well, there was a line that was scripted for Phyllis, and I really wish it had made it in.
其实菲利斯有一句剧本台词，我真希望它能保留下来。

748
00:27:37.470 --> 00:27:42.850
And I want to read it to you, because to me, it just shows how well Phyllis knows Angela.
我想读给你听，因为在我看来，这充分体现了菲利斯有多了解安吉拉。

749
00:27:43.570 --> 00:27:45.950
Phyllis would have said, I don't know.
菲利斯本该说，我不知道。

750
00:27:46.390 --> 00:27:49.510
Angela's a private person who doesn't do well with kindness.
安吉拉是个注重隐私的人，不太习惯接受别人的善意。

751
00:27:50.350 --> 00:27:51.990
Oh, that's such a good line.
噢，那句台词真棒。

752
00:27:52.110 --> 00:27:53.030
Isn't that perfect?
那不是很完美吗？

753
00:27:53.350 --> 00:27:54.210
That's so well written.
写得太好了。

754
00:27:54.870 --> 00:28:00.670
