我超爱埃内斯托的馅饼。

771
00:28:34.950 --> 00:28:36.930
And Jim's like, yeah, I love that restaurant, too.
吉姆说，是啊，我也很喜欢那家餐馆。

772
00:28:37.550 --> 00:28:40.830
And Toby goes, don't you mean food truck?
然后托比说，你是指那辆餐车吧？

773
00:28:41.670 --> 00:28:42.570
Oh, Dwight.
噢，德怀特。

774
00:28:42.770 --> 00:28:43.950
Dwight, this is it.
德怀特，就是现在。

775
00:28:44.210 --> 00:28:45.470
Dwight's ears go up.
德怀特竖起了耳朵。

776
00:28:45.590 --> 00:28:46.770
To prove that Jim is lying.
为了证明吉姆在撒谎。

777
00:28:47.170 --> 00:28:49.110
Dwight would make a very good mom detective.
德怀特会是个非常出色的妈妈侦探。

778
00:28:49.410 --> 00:28:52.350
This whole episode is just Dwight being a mom detective, honestly.
说实话，这一整集简直就是德怀特在当妈妈侦探。

779
00:28:52.630 --> 00:28:52.710
Yeah.
没错。

780
00:28:52.770 --> 00:28:57.370
And he doesn't really solve the crime that no one cared about.
而且他并没有真正破获那个根本没人关心的案子。

781
00:28:57.610 --> 00:28:58.470
It's perfect.
太完美了。

782
00:28:58.470 --> 00:28:59.470
He did it.
他做到了。

783
00:29:01.830 --> 00:29:05.330
Well, I think Oscar is so brilliant in this episode.
嗯，我觉得奥斯卡在这一集里真是太聪明了。

784
00:29:05.330 --> 00:29:06.610
I actually just saw him.
我其实刚见过他。

785
00:29:06.710 --> 00:29:07.310
We had lunch.
我们一起吃了午饭。

786
00:29:07.430 --> 00:29:13.290
And I was like, Oscar, when you gather everyone around before you walk into the hospital room
我对他说，奥斯卡，当你在走进病房前把大家召集起来时

787
00:29:13.290 --> 00:29:16.370
and you're like, listen, I don't know if you've ever seen a preemie baby.
你说，听着，我不知道你们有没有见过早产儿。

788
00:29:16.370 --> 00:29:17.750
It can be very shocking.
那可能会让人很震惊。

789
00:29:17.770 --> 00:29:19.710
Do not comment on it.
千万别乱评价。

790
00:29:19.710 --> 00:29:21.030
But I loved him in this scene.
但我很喜欢他在这一幕里的表现。

791
00:29:21.170 --> 00:29:21.910
He's so good.
他演得太好了。

792
00:29:21.910 --> 00:29:25.190
And then they go in and see the biggest baby ever.
然后他们进去一看，是个超级大的婴儿。

793
00:29:26.770 --> 00:29:29.670
I'll have you know that this hospital was not a real hospital.
我要告诉大家，这家医院并不是真正的医院。

794
00:29:29.830 --> 00:29:31.270
Angela, as you know, you were there.
安吉拉，如你所知，你当时也在场。

795
00:29:31.470 --> 00:29:34.450
This was a set that we built over on our warehouse stages.
这是我们在仓库摄影棚搭建的布景。

796
00:29:34.610 --> 00:29:34.790
Yep.
没错。

797
00:29:34.790 --> 00:29:38.050
That was my location report on the hospital, everybody.
以上就是我关于医院的拍摄地点报告，各位。

798
00:29:38.370 --> 00:29:38.550
Yeah.
是啊。

799
00:29:38.690 --> 00:29:40.550
It was great because we could walk back to our trailers.
这太棒了，因为我们可以直接走回拖车。

800
00:29:40.870 --> 00:29:41.570
I loved it.
我喜欢这样。

801
00:29:42.030 --> 00:29:45.790
Well, right away, Angela doesn't look happy to see any of her co-workers.
嗯，安吉拉一上来看到同事们就一脸不高兴。

802
00:29:45.970 --> 00:29:47.150
I think Phyllis was right.
我觉得菲利斯说得对。

803
00:29:48.290 --> 00:29:51.310
Kevin immediately remarks on how fat the baby is.
凯文立刻评论说这孩子长得真胖。

804
00:29:51.670 --> 00:29:53.410
And Oscar's like, what are you doing?
奥斯卡就问，你在干嘛呢？

805
00:29:53.450 --> 00:29:54.150
And he's like, what?
然后他说，怎么了？

806
00:29:54.170 --> 00:29:56.750
You said don't talk about it if it's small.
你说过如果孩子小就别提。

807
00:29:56.750 --> 00:29:58.930
You didn't say anything about it being giant.
你可没说如果孩子长得像巨人该怎么办。

808
00:29:58.930 --> 00:30:00.570
A big, giant, fat baby.
一个又大又胖的巨婴。

809
00:30:00.570 --> 00:30:04.870
The senator calls Philip substantial, and Aaron says he's more than that.
参议员说菲利普长得结实，亚伦说他何止是结实。

810
00:30:04.970 --> 00:30:05.810
He's a monster.
他简直是个怪物。

811
00:30:06.430 --> 00:30:07.150
I'm sorry.
抱歉。

812
00:30:07.250 --> 00:30:08.730
This baby is adorable.
这孩子真可爱。

813
00:30:09.070 --> 00:30:09.910
So cute.
太可爱了。

814
00:30:09.910 --> 00:30:13.390
In fact, I know who played little Philip Halstead Lipton.
其实，我知道是谁扮演了小菲利普·霍尔斯特德·利普顿。

815
00:30:13.550 --> 00:30:16.750
He was played by twins Allie and Suzanne Hartman.
他是由双胞胎艾莉和苏珊·哈特曼扮演的。

816
00:30:17.090 --> 00:30:19.510
So you're actually holding a little baby girls right there.
所以你当时抱着的其实是两个小女婴。

817
00:30:19.790 --> 00:30:20.010
Yeah.
没错。

818
00:30:20.250 --> 00:30:22.530
They were very sweet babies.
她们是非常甜美的小宝宝。

819
00:30:22.550 --> 00:30:23.890
They were so good.
她们表现得太好了。

820
00:30:24.230 --> 00:30:29.770
Well, just in case there was also a backup baby, Haley Escalante.
嗯，以防万一，还有一个替补宝宝，海莉·埃斯卡兰特。

821
00:30:30.570 --> 00:30:31.590
No, that's how they do it.
不，他们就是这么操作的。

822
00:30:31.710 --> 00:30:36.170
They cast the twins, the twin babies, but there's always a backup baby.
他们会选双胞胎宝宝，但总会准备一个替补宝宝。

823
00:30:36.430 --> 00:30:36.590
Yeah.
没错。

824
00:30:36.790 --> 00:30:40.450
Remember that episode when Pam brings her baby to Gabe's apartment?
还记得帕姆带孩子去盖博公寓的那集吗？

825
00:30:40.690 --> 00:30:44.170
You know, and Dwight has to like soothe the baby, and everybody was like, why does this
你知道的，德怀特得去哄孩子，大家都问，为什么这个

826
00:30:44.170 --> 00:30:45.310
baby look completely different?
孩子看起来完全不一样？

827
00:30:45.390 --> 00:30:46.810
We had to use a backup baby.
我们不得不用了替补宝宝。

828
00:30:46.930 --> 00:30:47.350
Backup.
替补。

829
00:30:47.550 --> 00:30:50.930
Yeah, because the other babies were like very awake.
对，因为其他宝宝当时太清醒了。

830
00:30:51.110 --> 00:30:51.810
They wouldn't sleep.
她们不肯睡觉。

831
00:30:51.950 --> 00:30:53.410
We needed a baby, a sleeper.
我们需要一个能睡觉的宝宝。

832
00:30:53.630 --> 00:30:55.730
These babies were just the cuteSt.
这些宝宝真是太可爱了。

833
00:30:55.730 --> 00:30:59.810
And I remember the mom was just standing right off camera there.
我记得当时妈妈就站在镜头外。

834
00:31:00.130 --> 00:31:04.350
And I remember talking to her and just how sweet she was.
我还记得和她聊天，她人特别好。

835
00:31:04.350 --> 00:31:06.190
And she was a fan of the show.
而且她还是这部剧的粉丝。

836
00:31:06.390 --> 00:31:09.350
And it was just, you know, it gave me baby fever.
这让我，你知道的，让我又想生孩子了。

837
00:31:09.490 --> 00:31:10.990
By this time, I had a toddler.
那时候我已经有个学步期的孩子了。

838
00:31:11.370 --> 00:31:11.570
Yeah.
是啊。

839
00:31:11.570 --> 00:31:12.490
I was like, no, no.
我当时想，不，不。

840
00:31:13.070 --> 00:31:14.130
Stay focused, Ange.
保持专注，安吉。

841
